Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Our great heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.07,0:01:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They were right in the middle of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Their magic worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They revived the ancient flying machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that time wizard\Nmust have done the trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You did it! You loved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a bon voyage!\NOur heroes! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look who it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Irritable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this means you\Nwant to come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.15,0:01:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we're on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm driving! I called it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm driving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.39,0:01:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back safely!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:01:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Slay the dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And we are off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, heroes. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I see an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting in there,\Nyou little foam suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friends are on a rescue mission\Nand you're not yanking them out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.17,0:02:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you direct your attention to\Nthe left side of our aircraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you can see that freaky floating castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,some clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and what appears to be a swarm of ferocious\Nwinged monsters ready to devour us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I couldn't be more ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Harpy Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Fierce Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, our monsters are kicking butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's hitting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.35,0:02:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now one of them launched the air mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords of revealing life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That stopped them monsters cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Eiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she's been digitized.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Joey. Charge ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've hit the magical barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if this ship lives up to its legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,then we should be able\Nto pass right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're totally home free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're almost at a\Ncastle of dark illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, not quite yet, turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A salamandra!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuts, we got hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She's falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, winged guardian of the fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quick thinking, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You programmed me to torment my\Ncaptives, not let them sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you weren't my\Nmost inspired creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Give yourself some credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look who I managed to snatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,His disguise didn't fool us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.29,0:05:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you're not in a\Nposition to be saving anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're about to join your brother\Nfor a dip in the Lava Pool of Atonement!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And once that ritual is completed,\Nthe mythic dragon will be unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Swordstalker, free my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, here! You're deaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a trip to the\Nrecycle bin, phantom. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue eyes, white dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast that phantom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with white lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,are ninjas like the ones who took\Nmy first blue eyes and it looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.33,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,they want a second one well this\Ntime i'm ready go trap master there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,now that dragon capture jar is destroyed\Nand the blue eyes that was taken
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,for me is back in my control so now\Ni have two and twice the firepower
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Mokuba, tell me,\Nhow is it you got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be mad, but I got Yugi\Nand his friends to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how I feel about Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't know who else to turn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see if we can escape this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:06:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A floating castle with its own forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think maybe Kaiba ought to\Nspend more time in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your guard up. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Cocoons of evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are they buzzing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's them, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a whole swarm of killer needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.91,0:07:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, fierce knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.85,0:07:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Man-eaters, this must be\None huge bug nest. Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand strong. Go! Zero Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That fire, it's disturbing the cocoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hatching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're full of more creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:08:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, no way we're gonna be able to\Ntake down all of them great mods.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can be done, Joey, with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A karibo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,On a catapult?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just a Karibo, but a team of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready for some fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, multiply!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Karibos self-destruct on\Ncontact with enemy monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those moths are done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time we terminate this rescue mission\Nand take this game to its final level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,From creepy forest to creepy cavern.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And still, no trace of Kaiba and Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, did you guys hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's definitely up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, Mokuba, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what a relief,\Nwe've been all worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you look like an\Novergrown monkey in that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Overgrown monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a thanks I get for\Ncoming to rescue, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, gamers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.51,0:09:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made it to the final level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Correction, you slime ball,\Nwe've beaten the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that what you think, Seto Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I escaped the lava pool,\Ntherefore the mythic dragon wasn't summoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and means this game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be game over, all\Nright, but for you, not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Huh? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They've rewritten the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're summoning the\Nmythic dragon themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.03,0:09:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll win together, or\Ntogether we'll fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.95,0:10:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, have I had it with\Nthis virtual reality stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Rescuing Kaiba was one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but now we've got to deal\Nwith this mythic dragon, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really starting to miss my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way we can\Nget out of this game. I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to take this\Ndragon down. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Me first, and I call out\Nthe Harvey Lady Sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another bit of\Nreprogramming that we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We call it the Dragon's Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and it makes this lair\Na sacred place where
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,only Dragon Class monsters\Nare allowed to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Every other monster type is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare challenge me\Nto a battle of dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.49,0:10:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You five should all know better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What I call the Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling dragons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Red-Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Harvey's pet dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.65,0:11:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I summon Curse of Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mythic dragon will not stand against\Nall we have set against it. Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,None of our attacks\Neven got through. You're
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,right those blasts must\Nhave canceled each other
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,out when they all collided\Nso they did but one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,of your team has no dragon\Nwith which to attack
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Or defend, isn't that right, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.61,0:11:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, he wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Block it, red eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.99,0:12:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey had his red eyes take\Nthe hit, but that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done for. Don't say that. Stay\Nwith us, please. You can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost him, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You creeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of sick, twisted\Ngame have you turned this into?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Game?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This ceased to be a game long\Nago We need a new tactic Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,with our dragons alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.95,0:12:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,we won't win this but i think\Ni know how we can what do you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,mean as strong as that mythic\Ndragon might be there's one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.93,0:13:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,creature that can beat it black
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,luster soldier i summon you by
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrificing the power of my dark\Nnight and my curse of dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,weren't you listening to what we just\Nsaid your blackluster soldier is not a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon therefore he can't attack but on\Nthe other hand we can still attack him No,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My pet dragon will stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll pay the price!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone, her dragon\Ncouldn't stand against it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.03,0:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it looks like I'm not gonna be around\Nto see how this whole thing turns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I tried my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess now, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My, with all my might, I will\Navenge you, you and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.05,0:14:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kaiba, this may be our one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to work as a team. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to trust me, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to do anything, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can win this battle in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.25,0:14:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll win nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of your group are already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we'll make it three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Time off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Call your ultimate dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sento, it's not your\Ndragon he's attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.35,0:14:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, your brother's sacrifice\Ndoesn't have to be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still win this, but\Nwe need to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan to defeat this beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you have to trust me, for it's\Nthe only way we can avenge our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now have faith and bring\Nout your ultimate beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, come out,\NBlue Eyes Ultimate Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you know what you're doing, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,names mean nothing Though that dragon is\Npowerful Ours is the ultimate one For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.49,0:15:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But once he has combined\Nhimself with another Your
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon's reign will be\Nthrough According to legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.85,0:15:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,when heroes are united They will\Ncreate a power strong enough to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the mythic dragon We will fulfill\Nthat prophecy now Go polymerization!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.03,0:15:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Go soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, ultimate dragon, combine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mythic dragon obliterate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, something has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the supreme Dragon Master Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now see his awesome powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those dragons were sent to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they be back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, something's even\Nhappening to our picking dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dragon Master Knight gains the attack
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,power of every dragon\Never played on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,including ones that\Nwere already destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, in the memory of Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My, Mokuba, we will topple your beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Dragon Master Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Saber Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.97,0:17:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.49,0:17:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Our heroes! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You slayed the dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Our heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What you've done will keep my people\Nand our land safe forevermore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not the ones that\Nyou should be cheering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't even be any cheering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my brother in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The losses you've\Nsuffered are too great for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.01,0:17:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,any hero to bear no matter\Nhow strong they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess is actually the mystical elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She's casting a spell to\Nbring back our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, oh man, what just happened to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The exit portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it a sec, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think the very least you\Ncould do is say thank you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I never asked for your help, and as far\Nas I'm concerned, I never needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.61,0:18:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you on the other hand,\NI will offer some gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.05,0:18:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We made a good team, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't think it means we'll\Nbe partnering up in true reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, but despite whatever grudge you\Nmay still hold against me and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps you can at least\Nbegin to stop looking
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,at us as just adversaries\Nand more as friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Noguba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.53,0:19:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.31,0:19:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pretty cheery guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, our heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brave deeds will\Nalways be remembered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And we will always remember\Nall of you. See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.11,0:19:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Joey, you're all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And so is Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably getting\Nout of his pod right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.47,0:19:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And without you guys to guard your bosses,\NI'd say he's about to kick some butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get back. We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of wimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She was here all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In the flesh, is everything cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:19:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.47,0:20:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So thanks. Oh, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go on and get out of here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother probably\Ncan't wait to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks again, you guys. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.81,0:20:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Mokuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where's the John?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I had, like, seven sodas\Nbefore we got in those pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,John!
